# Ctrl+\ on a project entry with child projects offers Collapse Entry, which folds it in the Navigator.
size 100 30
file <<END
Work:
	Launch:
		- Venue
Home:
	- Sink
END
keys . <C-g>
see │▌▾Work
keys <C-\>
see Collapse Entry
type collapse
keys <Enter>
see ▸Work
hide Launch                                  1
see Home
quit
